  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal models with multiprofile, pca_n2000 RNA encoder, resnet50 image encoder, avgpool aggregation, and weighted fusion achieve the highest validation accuracy (0.639). This experiment tests replacing the image encoder with a more powerful 'imagenet_vit_l' while keeping other parameters identical to isolate the impact of the image encoder choice. This clarifies whether upgrading the image encoder could further improve performance, balancing exploitation of the current top-performing setup with exploration of key design choices."
